<title>MEXICO: Hylsamex to propose 0.64 peso dividend.</title>
<headline>Hylsamex to propose 0.64 peso dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Board members of Mexican steelmaking firm Hylsamex will propose a dividend of 0.64 peso for each outstanding share at a forthcoming shareholders' assembly, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>The dividend would be made in a one-time payment as of April 7, 1997, Hylsamex said.</p>
<p>An ordinary general shareholders' meeting will take place on March 3.</p>
<p>((--Monterrey bureau +528 345-7617))</p>
